# This UI uses same-origin /v1 requests through the local Vite proxy.
# Start the backend on http://127.0.0.1:8000 and the UI on port 3000.
# No Gemini key or provider API key is required in frontend configuration.
# LLM credentials remain in Backend/.env.
# Optional, for environments that intentionally disable hot reload:
# DISABLE_HMR=true
